Package: mspTools
Title: Proteomics Analysis and Annotation Tools
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Nico", "Hüttmann", , "huttmann.nico@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-9321-2675"))
Description: Annotation and visualisation tools for proteomics data, built on
    'msTools' and 'msArrow'. Retrieves UniProt, GO and InterPro annotations,
    and provides heatmaps and PELSA-style plots on top of the dataset store.
